| sm | 8px | Compact elements |
| md | 16px | Standard spacing |
| lg | 24px | Section spacing |
| xl | 32px | Large gaps |
| 2xl | 48px | Section dividers |

### Border Radius

| Element | Radius |
|---------|--------|
| Buttons | 8px |
| Cards | 12px |
| Inputs | 8px |
| Modals | 16px |
| Pills/Tags | 9999px |

